# Disk Acquisition
## i. Purpose

The purpose of this stage was to acquire a forensic copy of the Windows 10 victim disk for further investigation.

## ii. Tool Used

i. FTK Imager  
ii. Windows 10 victim machine  
iii. External storage

## iii. Acquisition Process

I used FTK Imager to acquire the disk from the Windows 10 victim machine.

The image was created in **E01 format** and saved to external storage. I worked with the acquired image during the investigation instead of directly analyzing the original disk.

## iv. Evidence Information

i. Case ID: CASE-001  
ii. Evidence: Windows 10 victim disk  
iii. Image format: E01  
iv. Acquisition tool: FTK Imager

## v. Integrity

After the acquisition, I generated a hash for the evidence and recorded it for integrity verification.

## vi. Result

The disk image was successfully acquired and preserved for the next stages of the investigation, including artifact collection and analysis.
